{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start your engines \u2014 with your keyboard.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026490/extras/b7695f2cedc6ef656d5406ec550d8d58.poster.avif?t=1758388277\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026490/extras/b7695f2cedc6ef656d5406ec550d8d58.webm?t=1758388277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026490/extras/b7695f2cedc6ef656d5406ec550d8d58.mp4?t=1758388277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Type Drivers</strong> is a typing-based racing game where your keyboard speed determines how fast your car goes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>This demo includes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 locations</strong> available for racing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 different cars</strong> to unlock and try out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online racing</strong> with random players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo rides</strong> if no players are found.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50 texts</strong> available for typing during races.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Car painting</strong> is unlocked and free in the demo (no in-game money required).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full version will feature more tracks, cars, texts, customization options, and additional gameplay features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4026490?t=1758388277","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackgroun